//forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4941_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-06T12:06:01-07:00","id":944986,"title":"","content":"*downloads brochure...*<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> But... But I want page 22 and 23! Why on earth...?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T02:44:51-07:00","id":945379,"title":"","content":"I believe the missing pages in the brochure are a problem with the file; we're not trying to conceal anything in there. We'll look into it when we're back from Gen Con.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T18:21:25-07:00","id":945782,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cielago</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/944403-gen-con-news?p=944468#post944468\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">apparently theres a Trinity Continuum game going on right now. maybe someone who got into that will come back and give us some news. or barring that maybe the material from the game will get posted somewhere</div> </div> </div> </div>I was in the &quot;Distress Call Redux&quot; game and it used the old rules for the game. The &quot;Distress Call&quot; game used the old rules as well. I can't speak for the other Trinity sessions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T10:34:11-07:00","id":946271,"title":"","content":"The brochure says nothing that we don't already know. What a let down.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=485\" data-tempid=\"temp_485_1538393298974_786\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1277-karpomatic","name":"karpomatic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1277_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T17:06:22-07:00","id":947334,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure what anyone expected; none of the core books have been released yet, so we're not going to start talking about much else in the brochure until they are.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T06:34:28-07:00","id":947718,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/944403-gen-con-news?p=947334#post947334\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not sure what anyone expected; none of the core books have been released yet, so we're not going to start talking about much else in the brochure until they are.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Most of the mechanical information in the preview seems like a repeat of the teasers posted on 2 June 2015. I haven't analyzed it word-for-word, but my initial read-through reaction was &quot;I've seen all this before.&quot; Maybe the target audience (Gen Con attendees) was assumed to not have seen -- or not to remember -- the 2015 releases.<br /> <br /> (Except for the Fate damage system -- I didn't recall that from the previous material.)<br /> <br /> (Also: super disappointed that all of the examples were from Scion. No love for Aeon, Aberant, or Adventure?)<br /> <br /> I was hoping for more material to get me fired up about the setting. The mechanics are well and good, but my love for Aeon comes from the setting, not (and sometimes in spite of) the mechanics.<br /> <br /> The Youtube video? Now that's what I was hoping for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6254-paulchapman","name":"PaulChapman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T07:39:30-07:00","id":947760,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PaulChapman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/944403-gen-con-news?p=947718#post947718\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Most of the mechanical information in the preview seems like a repeat of the teasers posted on 2 June 2015. I haven't analyzed it word-for-word, but my initial read-through reaction was &amp;quot;I've seen all this before.&amp;quot; Maybe the target audience (Gen Con attendees) was assumed to not have seen -- or not to remember -- the 2015 releases.<br /> <br /> (Except for the Fate damage system -- I didn't recall that from the previous material.)<br /> <br /> (Also: super disappointed that all of the examples were from Scion. No love for Aeon, Aberant, or Adventure?)<br /> <br /> I was hoping for more material to get me fired up about the setting. The mechanics are well and good, but my love for Aeon comes from the setting, not (and sometimes in spite of) the mechanics.<br /> <br /> The Youtube video? Now that's what I was hoping for.</div> </div> </div> </div>As much as we'd love to think that every past Trinity Continuum fan is reading our site and staying on top of developments, that's really not a likely scenario, so we need to repeat things posted here in a booklet designed to be spread throughout Gen Con, the single largest concentration of gamers in one place we can reach. In addition, Scion 2nd is coming out before the Trinity Continuum and will be having its Kickstarter at the end of this month if things work as we are planning, with TC coming up next year. That gives both of our Onyx Path owned game lines a chance to shine, and gives the TC a chance to benefit from any lessons learned during the Scion 2nd launch.<br /> <br /> So yes, love and care and thought has been devoted to both game worlds, thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T19:35:46-07:00","id":948280,"title":"","content":"Any news on when Trinity might make it onto KS?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T20:52:01-07:00","id":948321,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RichT</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/944403-gen-con-news?p=947760#post947760\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As much as we'd love to think that every past Trinity Continuum fan is reading our site and staying on top of developments, that's really not a likely scenario, so we need to repeat things posted here in a booklet designed to be spread throughout Gen Con, the single largest concentration of gamers in one place we can reach.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd guess about half the people I spoke to at Gen Con about Trinity (or Scion, for that matter) were delighted to discover that new editions were coming out, because they had no idea.<br /> <br /> People who are discussing this material on our website have probably already seen the teasers on our website. But most potentially interested gamers? Probably not.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leetsepeak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/944403-gen-con-news?p=948280#post948280\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any news on when Trinity might make it onto KS?</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RichT</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/944403-gen-con-news?p=947760#post947760\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In addition, Scion 2nd is coming out before the Trinity Continuum and will be having its Kickstarter at the end of this month if things work as we are planning, <b>with TC coming up next year</b>.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T06:14:28-07:00","id":948552,"title":"","content":"I love the Trinity Continuum setting, but I have not been following the development as it progresses. I tend to check in every year or so since OP acquired the property to see what's what. I spoke with Ian at Gencon and was very excited to hear about what's planned. The Storypath system overview was a great way to catch up with what is going on since I have not been following the day-to-day.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}